      "writtenOn": "2025-09-23T15:49:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I personally feel, the code will not be much complicated. In the pkvm side, we need to to host_gpa2hpa(), but other than that, the logic would not change much. But I am fine with this implementation as well if you prefer this implementation :-)",
      "parentUuid": "c1166601_fa3826d0",
      "revId": "85b46c509c3e35aef94cb3bd5335fe0758056a4c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
